{"id":"navre_","lemma":"navré","pos":"adj","rank":1721,"glosses":["sad; saddened","heartbroken","deeply or very sorry; distressed"],"ipa":"/na.vʁe/","forms":{"feminine":"navrée","masculinePlural":"navrés","femininePlural":"navrées"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/9/9c/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-VictorDtmtc-navr%C3%A9.wav","examples":[{"text":"Vous nous en voyez navrées.","en":"We're very sorry about that.","words":[{"g":"you"},{"g":"we / us"},{"g":"in / of it"},{"g":"to see","l":"voir"},null]},{"text":"Je suis navré de ne pas pouvoir vous retrouver ce soir.","en":"I'm sorry I can't meet you tonight.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"am","l":"être"},null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"can, to be able to"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"to find"},{"g":"this / it"},{"g":"evening"}]},{"text":"Je suis navrée, je n'ai pas pu vous écrire plus tôt.","en":"I'm sorry I couldn't write to you sooner.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"am","l":"être"},null,{"g":"I"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"have","l":"avoir"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"can, to be able to","l":"pouvoir"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"to write"},{"g":"more / no longer"},{"g":"early"}]},{"text":"Je suis navré, mais il n'y a vraiment pas d'autre solution.","en":"I'm very sorry, but there's really no alternative.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"am","l":"être"},null,{"g":"but"},{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"there"},{"g":"has","l":"avoir"},{"g":"truly"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"other"},{"g":"solution"}]},{"text":"Je suis navrée, je n'ai pas pu t'écrire plus tôt.","en":"I'm sorry I couldn't write to you sooner.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"am","l":"être"},null,{"g":"I"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"have","l":"avoir"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"can, to be able to","l":"pouvoir"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"to write"},{"g":"more / no longer"},{"g":"early"}]}]}